  <item>
    <title>18. 熬汤第三年：用刚刚好的努力，让练习服务于生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6710f51e0d2f24f289db68ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6710f51e0d2f24f289db68ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Oct 2024 11:29:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">1:02</a> 进入阿汤练习的第三年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">2:02</a> 灵魂拷问：你的阿汤练习是不是过分努力了？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>三类学生：过分努力、懒散、刚刚好的努力</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a> 新同学要努力一些，老同学的努力成分要少一些</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>方法上有为，心态上无为</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>长期的练习者的状态：松、静、柔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 放松一点，再放松一点</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>越放松，越强大</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>练习是一面镜子，照见你真实的生活状态</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 享受你的练习</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>让体式服务于练习</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>无分别心地去做体式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>找回孩子般玩耍的感觉</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 如何在过分努力和懒散之间找平衡？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>保持规律练习的习惯，但不执着于结果</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>放松，也是需要练习的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>先觉知，再慢慢修正</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>多一些无所事事的时间</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a> 瑜伽如何服务于我的生活？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>倾听身体的声音，相信她自有智慧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不再一味地追求效率，允许自己慢一点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有觉知地选择有形无形的信息输入</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>发展以自己为原点的坐标系</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Hai Ku - Cavewoman</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Alexia Chellun - I Am Grateful</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loasvwz-8yFuSJzegJb6D5vw6TiU.m4a" length="63654765" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjDIOtw6e1OnCPhJvL-hCshoVZ7c.jpg"/>
