  <item>
    <title>17. 没有社会性进步的一年，遇见了自己的“无用之用”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a0652c7349f7a5571956a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a0652c7349f7a5571956a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jul 2024 02:21:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>外部世界是我们内心的显现，一切都在转念之间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>May we be happy. May we be at ease.</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕕 Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">2:13</a> 从有用之用到无用之用</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《庄子》小故事之「土地神的树」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有用和无用都是相对的</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> “无用的”探索世界</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>扩展了我看世界的角度</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>探索世界的同时探索自己</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> “无用的”感受</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>少用大脑思考，多用身体和心感受</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>勇敢地把自己的感受放在第一位</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>庄子的“相忘于江湖”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> “无用的”看不见的能量</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>人体三种能量结构： 元气、中气、清气</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>养护能量，让生活状态转从内耗到滋养</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a> “无用的”阴瑜伽</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Yin is In</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>阴瑜伽练习的是自我接纳、自我关怀、允许和臣服</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>将觉知延伸到垫子之外，生活处处是修行</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> “无用的”结果</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>不执着于结果，只是去把事情做好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>放下执着和分别心，所见之处都是“道”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>禅宗公案之 「大道透长安」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> “无用之用”养活了我</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>把播客作为一个技能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>越简单，越自由</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Alexia Chellun - Abundance</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Alexia Chellun - As I Wake in the Morning</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚书籍推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《庄子今注今译》陈鼓应</span></p><span></span><p><span>《经典中医启蒙》李辛</span></p><span></span><p><span>《圣严说禅》圣严法师</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Complete Guide to Yin Yoga: The Philosophy and Practice of Yin Yoga》by Bernie Clark</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎨 封面图</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自朋友十元尼美的画《生活不用太用力》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgPtN6mOd5f8myc9Wl-Ds6ozFKku.m4a" length="81927396" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fogt-mhyGRN2csZfAQXl5pmNVPCv.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>17</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>16. 闹市遇劫匪，沙漠看星空，在智利体验混乱与魔幻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664dda354efbc0c3dc55b0ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664dda354efbc0c3dc55b0ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 11:42:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>南美背包旅行第二站，我们从阿根廷的门多萨飞往了智利首都圣地亚哥。在圣地亚哥的第二天，就在去市集的路上体会了一把南美的混乱与魔幻。在大街上被抢的经历使得整个智利之行的心情变得复杂又小心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>匆匆离开圣地亚哥，便来到了智利北部的非极地沙漠地区Elqui Valley。这里有透蓝无云的天空、生命力旺盛的仙人掌和随处可见的葡萄藤。落脚的Airbnb小木屋就在山谷的半山腰，房东奶奶打理着一片小果园，里面种着葡萄、无花果、梨、牛油果、棉花…… 正好赶上南美丰收的季节，幸福地实现了几天水果自由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>住在山谷中的那几天，宁静又规律的生活抚平了之前心情的波荡起伏。旅行，原本就不存在一帆风顺，唯有安住于当下的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤 主播：Nicole, Tian</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕖 Timestamp</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">4:09</a> 智利第一站：圣地亚哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">5:28</a> 本次南美旅行唯一一次青旅选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">6:38</a> 必吃美食：Ceviche</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">8:21</a> 去市集的路上被抢劫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 因为瑜伽，正念步行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 出国前务必买保险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 宝藏咖啡小哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 自酿酒吧：Cerveceria SpoH</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 自酿酒吧②： Alameda Beer Company</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 在圣地亚哥练瑜伽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 素食餐厅：El Huerto</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 智利第二站：北部的Elqui Valley山谷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 智利秘鲁的Pisco发源地之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 去专业天文台看满天星星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 住在半山腰的果园Airbnb</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> 本地大爷果汁店：DIY店内的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a> 山谷里的magic monent: 突然能绑上马里奇C</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> 《孤独星球》推荐精酿酒吧: Cervecería Guayacán</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span>Victor Jara - Caminando, Caminando (2001 Digital Remaster)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgiAGaEENsuDvZoQvK33jCkkSN0k.m4a" length="110262652" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0nLvb9c2yeX96yfWr4AJ8GMRML.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>16</itunes:episode>
