  <item>
    <title>15. 说走就走的南美背包旅行之阿根廷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66323e9a03bcdd73a90a812d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66323e9a03bcdd73a90a812d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2024 13:07:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年二月，我们来到了距离中国（大部分区域）最远的国家——阿根廷。作为南美之行的第一站，我们还算比较深度地体验了首都布宜诺斯艾利斯、户外旅行圣地巴塔哥尼亚北部的巴里洛切，以及阿根廷最大的葡萄产区门多萨。探戈、远足、大饺子，住了葡萄庄园，体验了本地人家里的烤肉（asado）派对。家属作为精酿啤酒的资深爱好者，自然还少不了探寻阿根廷本地精酿酒厂。本期节目，和你分享我们在阿根廷两周的快乐时光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤 主播：Nicole, Tian</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕖 Timestamp</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">2:56</a> 为什么选择阿根廷作为南美旅行第一站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">6:24</a> 签证准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">7:12</a> 基本生存：换美元、取钱、办电话卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 航空公司高端会员匹配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 布宜诺斯艾利斯（BA）初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 南美排名第一的牛排馆：Don Julio</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 阿根廷传统美食：Asado（烤肉）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> Tripadvisor 上预定的红酒烧烤之夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 看探戈：Tango Porteno &amp; Bar Sur</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 阿根廷国粹：马黛茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">31:47</a> 必吃国菜：Empanada “大饺子”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 阿根廷精酿一站喝爽：Beer Cellar</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 自酿精酿酒馆推荐：Strange Brewing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 周日逛集市：San Telmo Market</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 必逛街区：La Baca 博卡区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> 阿根廷人的度假胜地：巴里洛切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> 南美最有效率的交通出行方式竟然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 解锁新爱好：户外徒步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3247">54:07</a> Patagonia 酒厂参观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3421">57:01</a> 住Airbnb 普通人家里的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3730">1:02:10</a> 巴里洛切必吃：巧克力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3904">1:05:04</a> 巴里洛切必喝：德式手工啤酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4017">1:06:57</a> 门多萨：阿根廷最著名的葡萄酒产区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4333">1:12:13</a> 三天的葡萄酒酒庄之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4868">1:21:08</a> 住在葡萄庄园和农场是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4997">1:23:17</a> 和农场主一家相处的三天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5101">1:25:01</a> 住民宿付款遇到的小插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5206">1:26:46</a> 门多萨自然发酵啤酒厂推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span>John Powell - Assassin's Tango</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mercedes Sosa &amp; León Gieco &amp; Antonio Tarragó Ros &amp; Peteco Carabajal - Canción Para Carito</span></p>]]></description>
