  <item>
    <title>11. 十多年的自我探索之路：他逃离“精英主义”，治愈了内在小孩 （全英）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d7aa1b0bef6c2074364525</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d7aa1b0bef6c2074364525</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Feb 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期，和大家分享一个身边真实的几次"重启人生"并逐渐活出自己的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事的主人公是一位男性，已经年过半百，他来自德国，曾做着高薪的咨询工作。常年高强度高压的工作，除了让身心透支之外，他丝毫没有觉得真正地开心。他还一度面临职场霸凌，曾陷入抑郁的状态。但也因此，他的自我觉醒之路开始。从最初的没有选择到一步步掌控自己的人生，成为了自己想成为的人。创业之余，他还通过coaching和training，帮助了不少走在自我成长道路上的年轻人，也更多地了解了自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>过去十多年的冥想经历和自我探索，不仅疗愈了来自童年和原生家庭的创伤，也拨开了眼前的层层迷雾，触达了生命原本的丰盛与爱。在疗愈自己的过程中，他变成了一个更加平和、稳定和慈爱的人。去年，他还写了一本关于如何克服恐惧的书，试图去帮助那些同样想改变自己的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客是在巴厘岛乌布的一家cafe录制，录音环境并不理想，且在最后的十分钟下起了倾盆大雨。一切都不在计划之中，我们能做的，只是接受一切的发生，投身于对话本身。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Nicole &nbsp;嘉宾：Oliver Selch</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> Change step 1: from serving to freedom, take charge of my life</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> Change step 2: from pleasure to goodness, take charge of my health</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> Increase awareness</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> Connect to "myself from tomorrow"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a> Change step 3: Connect deeper to myself and others, spiritual development and training</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> "Washing machine" experience</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> Get through layers of negative emotions to "core" - &nbsp;love, joy, pure bliss</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> &nbsp;Connect to life force</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">50:13</a> &nbsp;Reduce effects of negativity-less drama</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> &nbsp;More kindness and understanding</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">1:01:4</a> Change step 4: Global citizens and travelers-explore the world</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">1:02:2</a> Do more inner work</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">1:03:2</a> Change step 5: from improving myself to giving to others</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3845">1:04:5</a> Wrote a book how to overcome fear to make a meaningful change</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3963">1:06:3</a> Plan to give "Change your life" seminar</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4023">1:07:3</a> How to balance the logical and intuitive mind</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4204">1:10:4</a> Key learnings</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Mahesa Ram Group - Sue Joo Swami</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Guru Ganesha Singh - Hari Om</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制当天，我还抽了一张塔罗牌。宇宙妈妈和我说：slowing down---姑娘，别那么着急，慢一点也没关系的 :)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5m12mn9RQBI5L5_I2yg1UmzHpI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
